Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 22:32:05 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] refactor(net)!: migrate user download packets to typed VO
 models

Adapt card, character, charge, course and detail queries to immutable VOs. Add regression coverage for request payloads, pagination, required fields and error callbacks.

BREAKING CHANGE: The five user download packet classes are now internal.

